{"4251460":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered","steam_appid":4251460,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"The ultimate kaiju arena brawler is back, completely remastered. From Atari and original developer, Pipeworks, Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered updates the 2002 fighter with enhanced visuals and quality of life improvements. Choose your monster and battle it out with a range of brutal attacks through 8 locations, each with day and night variations. Battle through real-world cities, Monster Island, and the alien Mothership. Face off against your friends in local co-op or new online multiplayer. <br><br>Master your skills in cinematic kaiju vs. kaiju battles through familiar cities. Every monster has a distinctive moveset that makes each brawl unique, from vicious melee attacks to ranged energy blasts to special Rage Mode strikes. Tired of throwing punches? Why not throw a skyscraper, instead? The arenas are not just passive locations, and instead allow you to use the environment strategically in combat and even weaponize buildings and other landmarks.<br><br>The visuals throughout the game have been remastered from the ground up to enhance the cinematic experience of the original. Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered also features gameplay updates, as well as an improved unlock system, so you can unlock monsters, locations, and gallery items in any order you choose.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The original 2002 Godzilla arena fighter, remastered. <br><\/li><li>12 Kaiju to choose from, each with a uniquely vicious moveset.<br><\/li><li>8 locations, including recreated real-world cities, Monster Island, and the Alien Mothership.<br><\/li><li>Gallery items to unlock. <br><\/li><li>Play with friends in local co-op and all-new online multiplayer.<br><\/li><li>Remastered graphics enhance the cinematic experience of the original. <br><\/li><li>Improved unlock system gives you the choice to unlock monsters, locations, and gallery items in any order. <br><\/li><li>Also includes additional single-player campaigns for each kaiju.<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"The ultimate kaiju arena brawler is back, completely remastered. From Atari and original developer, Pipeworks, Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered updates the 2002 fighter with enhanced visuals and quality of life improvements. Choose your monster and battle it out with a range of brutal attacks through 8 locations, each with day and night variations. Battle through real-world cities, Monster Island, and the alien Mothership. Face off against your friends in local co-op or new online multiplayer. <br><br>Master your skills in cinematic kaiju vs. kaiju battles through familiar cities. Every monster has a distinctive moveset that makes each brawl unique, from vicious melee attacks to ranged energy blasts to special Rage Mode strikes. Tired of throwing punches? Why not throw a skyscraper, instead? The arenas are not just passive locations, and instead allow you to use the environment strategically in combat and even weaponize buildings and other landmarks.<br><br>The visuals throughout the game have been remastered from the ground up to enhance the cinematic experience of the original. Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered also features gameplay updates, as well as an improved unlock system, so you can unlock monsters, locations, and gallery items in any order you choose.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The original 2002 Godzilla arena fighter, remastered. <br><\/li><li>12 Kaiju to choose from, each with a uniquely vicious moveset.<br><\/li><li>8 locations, including recreated real-world cities, Monster Island, and the Alien Mothership.<br><\/li><li>Gallery items to unlock. <br><\/li><li>Play with friends in local co-op and all-new online multiplayer.<br><\/li><li>Remastered graphics enhance the cinematic experience of the original. <br><\/li><li>Improved unlock system gives you the choice to unlock monsters, locations, and gallery items in any order. <br><\/li><li>Also includes additional single-player campaigns for each kaiju.<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"The ultimate Godzilla arena brawler is back, completely remastered. Choose your monster and battle it out with a range of brutal attacks through recreated cities and other locations. Face off against your friends and foes in local co-op or new online multiplayer.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4251460\/28023d80b51185fe3dbadadf608523942f47238c\/header.jpg?t=1793286975","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4251460\/1c11c8b56f0aa851c372e6f8e818dc21e15eb586\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793286975","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4251460\/1c11c8b56f0aa851c372e6f8e818dc21e15eb586\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793286975","website":"https:\/\/atari.com\/products\/godzilla-destroy-all-monsters-melee-remastered","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit, Windows 11 preferred<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6 GB \/ AMD RX 580 8 GB, DirectX 12 \/ Shader Model 6 capable<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 6 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=